{"id":"0c5da08c-6938-4f8e-a6d6-f6b362c89cd7","expr":"result >= defaultValue","rationale":"If the fetched parameter value is positive, it is returned; otherwise, defaultValue is returned. So result >= defaultValue.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.URL#getMethodPositiveParameter(String,String,int):int","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/URL.java","createdAt":"2026-09-15T12:08:37.290833009Z"}
{"id":"43f26dfa-ceac-4ff8-8dfd-7dc66bb1f4eb","expr":"result > 0","rationale":"The method returns a positive value because if the retrieved value is not positive, it returns the positive defaultValue (which is > 0) instead.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.URL#getMethodPositiveParameter(String,String,short):short","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/URL.java","createdAt":"2026-09-15T12:08:37.302833152Z"}
{"id":"d1a83ab8-47b9-4a8c-9249-a0153c0029b5","expr":"result >= defaultValue","rationale":"Since result is either the positive parameter or defaultValue, it cannot be less than defaultValue.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.URL#getMethodPositiveParameter(String,String,short):short","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/URL.java","createdAt":"2026-09-15T12:08:37.302833152Z"}
{"id":"96d57f71-52d9-4e6a-83c1-324cda604453","expr":"defaultValue > 0","rationale":"The method throws IllegalArgumentException if defaultValue is less than or equal to 0, so at entry defaultValue must be positive.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.URL#getMethodPositiveParameter(String,String,int):int","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/URL.java","createdAt":"2026-09-15T12:08:37.316181485Z"}
