{"id":"6e24331e-a2a0-4307-a467-cc9db31a6da2","expr":"defaultValue > 0","rationale":"The method explicitly throws IllegalArgumentException if defaultValue is less or equal to zero; thus, it must be positive when entering the method.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.URL#getMethodPositiveParameter(String,String,byte):byte","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/URL.java","createdAt":"2026-09-15T12:08:37.325203839Z"}
