{"id":"825885e8-8e19-4a9b-a402-33303e505777","expr":"(method == null) || method.length() > 0","rationale":"If the method string is not null, presumably it should be non-empty as valid method names are not empty strings.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.URL#getMethodPositiveParameter(String,String,byte):byte","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/URL.java","createdAt":"2026-09-15T12:08:37.325203839Z"}
