{"id":"08d6bbe8-9dd9-4340-9330-ddd78bfc2bc5","expr":"method != null","rationale":"Since the method uses method as a parameter to fetch another parameter, it should be non-null.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.URL#getMethodParameter(String,String,boolean):boolean","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/URL.java","createdAt":"2026-09-15T12:08:37.377264168Z"}
