{"id":"af57edb6-3b79-42a9-ba78-3039dc35373c","expr":"type != null","rationale":"The method attempts to call type.getDeclaredMethod only if type is not null.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.MethodUtils#findMethod(Class,String,Class<?>):Method","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/MethodUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-15T12:13:24.451041740Z"}
{"id":"eac71889-951b-4ce2-9fcb-31fdb95861c9","expr":"methodName != null && !methodName.isEmpty()","rationale":"The method checks if methodName is not empty before calling getDeclaredMethod.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.MethodUtils#findMethod(Class,String,Class<?>):Method","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/MethodUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-15T12:13:24.451041740Z"}
{"id":"7c2fcd5e-925c-46a0-95b1-ed9f89724345","expr":"parameterTypes != null","rationale":"parameterTypes is the varargs argument for parameter types, usually not null at method entry.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.MethodUtils#findMethod(Class,String,Class<?>):Method","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/MethodUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-15T12:13:24.451041740Z"}
{"id":"1aab1470-197e-4440-94ce-8df462e90c95","expr":"!methodName.isEmpty()","rationale":"Only proceed if methodName is not empty.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.MethodUtils#findMethod(Class,String,Class<?>):Method","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/MethodUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-15T12:13:24.451041740Z"}
{"id":"b7bf7c35-842c-4864-9df1-75abdad511e0","expr":"type != null && (methodName == null || methodName.isEmpty()) || parameterTypes != null","rationale":"Allows reasoning about parameter relationships and method execution path.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.MethodUtils#findMethod(Class,String,Class<?>):Method","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/MethodUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-15T12:13:24.451041740Z"}
{"id":"f86f8be5-c71d-4db5-bae4-29c9ff0dc0b9","expr":"result == null || result.getName().equals(methodName)","rationale":"The method returns either null or a Method with the exact requested methodName","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.MethodUtils#findMethod(Class,String,Class<?>):Method","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/MethodUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-15T12:13:24.473623714Z"}
{"id":"a265d418-55d9-4693-b326-82135e5cb298","expr":"result == null || result.getDeclaringClass() == type","rationale":"If a method is found, it must be declared by the given type","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.MethodUtils#findMethod(Class,String,Class<?>):Method","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/MethodUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-15T12:13:24.473623714Z"}
{"id":"bb609e8f-e401-4029-906d-5d4d4b3fe77d","expr":"object != null","rationale":"The method calls object.getClass(), so object must not be null.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.MethodUtils#invokeMethod(Object,String,Object):T","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/MethodUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-15T12:13:24.492766Z"}
{"id":"a6047b69-3cee-4729-ae48-9a76a2fe1a84","expr":"methodName != null","rationale":"To find a method by name, methodName should not be null.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.MethodUtils#invokeMethod(Object,String,Object):T","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/MethodUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-15T12:13:24.492766Z"}
{"id":"e03fde7d-8bbb-4379-9922-7a12ab67e5fa","expr":"methodParameters == null || methodParameters.getClass().isArray()","rationale":"methodParameters is declared as Object..., so either null or an array of Objects.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.MethodUtils#invokeMethod(Object,String,Object):T","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/MethodUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-15T12:13:24.492766Z"}
{"id":"38b31914-0fd0-4117-8ea2-ded5ddaf8058","expr":"object.getClass() != null","rationale":"The Class object for the runtime type of object is never null.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.MethodUtils#invokeMethod(Object,String,Object):T","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/MethodUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-15T12:13:24.492766Z"}
{"id":"ffb1bee0-d72b-4a06-a189-4d1b573fbbf0","expr":"(methodParameters == null) || (methodParameters.length >= 0)","rationale":"methodParameters is either null or a (possibly empty) array.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.MethodUtils#invokeMethod(Object,String,Object):T","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/MethodUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-15T12:13:24.492766Z"}
{"id":"cad01497-2ddc-4aa9-9021-8e552d924bd1","expr":"object != null && methodName != null && methodParameters != null && result != null","rationale":"Since the method invokes a method reflectively, if it returns normally, result should not be null (assuming underlying method does not return null).","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.MethodUtils#invokeMethod(Object,String,Object):T","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/MethodUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-15T12:13:24.510817091Z"}
{"id":"0761c812-d99c-493c-97ad-b0379cb11cb8","expr":"overrider != null && overridden != null && !Objects.equals(overrider, overridden)","rationale":"Both methods must be non-null and unequal for override to be possible.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.MethodUtils#overrides(Method,Method):boolean","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/MethodUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-15T12:13:24.527541732Z"}
{"id":"a4b5b8d7-0e08-4562-b49c-4d1d8ce7b1b0","expr":"overridden.getDeclaringClass().isAssignableFrom(overrider.getDeclaringClass())","rationale":"The overrider's declaring class is assignable to the overridden's declaring class.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.MethodUtils#overrides(Method,Method):boolean","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/MethodUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-15T12:13:24.527541732Z"}
{"id":"c08195dc-2705-4b65-8767-c05b1255e487","expr":"Objects.equals(overrider.getName(), overridden.getName()) && overrider.getParameterCount() == overridden.getParameterCount()","rationale":"Method names and parameter counts are equal.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.MethodUtils#overrides(Method,Method):boolean","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/MethodUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-15T12:13:24.527541732Z"}
{"id":"d7c6e037-6f13-497e-8b69-7646a68dd398","expr":"result || (overrider != null && overridden != null)","rationale":"The method returns false immediately if overrider or overridden is null.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.MethodUtils#overrides(Method,Method):boolean","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/MethodUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-15T12:13:24.544249362Z"}
{"id":"261ede53-a674-4699-914a-0f2f0b5fbaf5","expr":"result || !Objects.equals(overrider, overridden)","rationale":"If the method returns true, the two Method objects are not equal.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.MethodUtils#overrides(Method,Method):boolean","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/MethodUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-15T12:13:24.544249362Z"}
{"id":"33434ffd-d127-4138-aef2-46f452a04ef4","expr":"result || overridden.getDeclaringClass().isAssignableFrom(overrider.getDeclaringClass())","rationale":"The declaring class of overrider is a subclass or the same as overridden's when result is true.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.MethodUtils#overrides(Method,Method):boolean","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/MethodUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-15T12:13:24.544249362Z"}
{"id":"301effa5-f2d1-4ba0-b818-0ae50f7411b4","expr":"overrider != null","rationale":"The method operates on the 'overrider' parameter, invoking instance methods on it. Thus 'overrider' must be non-null.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.MethodUtils#findNearestOverriddenMethod(Method):Method","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/MethodUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-15T12:13:24.561455932Z"}
{"id":"6a22ec74-de5f-4db6-b540-635b08751cba","expr":"overrider.getDeclaringClass() != null","rationale":"According to the Java Reflection API contracts, Method#getDeclaringClass always returns a non-null Class<?> object.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.MethodUtils#findNearestOverriddenMethod(Method):Method","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/MethodUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-15T12:13:24.561455932Z"}
{"id":"30919ab0-c679-4bd2-81e8-aaca76b94f2b","expr":"!overrider.isSynthetic()","rationale":"Synthetic methods do not participate in typical override semantics, so generally the overridden finder considers non-synthetic methods.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.MethodUtils#findNearestOverriddenMethod(Method):Method","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/MethodUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-15T12:13:24.561455932Z"}
{"id":"982211f4-b02f-435e-aaa5-04ec3e289802","expr":"overrider.getParameterCount() >= 0","rationale":"Ensures the parameter count of the overrider method is a valid number (non-negative).","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.MethodUtils#findNearestOverriddenMethod(Method):Method","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/MethodUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-15T12:13:24.561455932Z"}
{"id":"2463903f-52ba-431d-a122-736abf3cb337","expr":"overrider.getReturnType() != null","rationale":"Method#getReturnType returns a non-null Class<?> instance reflecting the method's return type.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.MethodUtils#findNearestOverriddenMethod(Method):Method","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/MethodUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-15T12:13:24.561455932Z"}
{"id":"75796814-a37e-47a8-bdbc-ad69355c29ca","expr":"result == null || (result != overrider && result.getName().equals(overrider.getName()))","rationale":"The method returns either null or an overridden method of overrider with the same name.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.MethodUtils#findNearestOverriddenMethod(Method):Method","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/MethodUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-15T12:13:24.578136211Z"}
{"id":"f8d24b70-1086-4536-8f37-8b20f96cdbe8","expr":"result == null || result.getDeclaringClass().isAssignableFrom(overrider.getDeclaringClass())","rationale":"Overridden methods must be declared in a superclass or superinterface.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.MethodUtils#findNearestOverriddenMethod(Method):Method","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/MethodUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-15T12:13:24.578136211Z"}
{"id":"cfba0629-4936-4854-b41a-65bf2ba1fe03","expr":"result == null || result.getParameterCount() == overrider.getParameterCount()","rationale":"Overriding methods have the same signature parameter count.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.MethodUtils#findNearestOverriddenMethod(Method):Method","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/MethodUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-15T12:13:24.578136211Z"}
{"id":"310db00c-d03d-4e2e-bfab-da1b8d5300e4","expr":"result == null || !result.equals(overrider)","rationale":"The result, if non-null, is different from the overrider method itself.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.MethodUtils#findNearestOverriddenMethod(Method):Method","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/MethodUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-15T12:13:24.578136211Z"}
{"id":"ccbfeec0-475e-4ef7-b126-0865a4c45861","expr":"overrider != null","rationale":"The method findOverriddenMethod assumes overrider is valid and non-null to perform logic on it.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.MethodUtils#findOverriddenMethod(Method,Class<?>):Method","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/MethodUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-15T12:13:24.592798277Z"}
{"id":"e4005de0-3615-4fd9-83a5-7043e507cc16","expr":"declaringClass != null","rationale":"A null declaringClass would prevent performing reflective lookups.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.MethodUtils#findOverriddenMethod(Method,Class<?>):Method","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/MethodUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-15T12:13:24.592798277Z"}
{"id":"806d8bb4-e62f-49de-9edb-e01e8dead95d","expr":"declaringClass.isAssignableFrom(overrider.getDeclaringClass())","rationale":"Overrides occur when the overrider is declared in a subclass of or the same class as declaringClass.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.MethodUtils#findOverriddenMethod(Method,Class<?>):Method","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/MethodUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-15T12:13:24.592798277Z"}
{"id":"84ce9328-a256-46e0-9501-04325646b7d7","expr":"overrider.getParameterCount() >= 0","rationale":"Java methods cannot have negative parameter counts.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.MethodUtils#findOverriddenMethod(Method,Class<?>):Method","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/MethodUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-15T12:13:24.592798277Z"}
{"id":"a0bee4b7-f56b-4c2c-a58b-be344d9f2bd3","expr":"overrider.getName() != null","rationale":"All Java Method instances have non-null names.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.MethodUtils#findOverriddenMethod(Method,Class<?>):Method","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/MethodUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-15T12:13:24.592798277Z"}
{"id":"a8ec7592-6f23-4557-86ec-ccf2ab9eced0","expr":"result == null || declaringClass.isAssignableFrom(result.getDeclaringClass())","rationale":"Since the found overridden method must be declared in a class assignable from declaringClass, this captures proper overriding hierarchy.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.MethodUtils#findOverriddenMethod(Method,Class<?>):Method","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/MethodUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-15T12:13:24.608684240Z"}
{"id":"70f97684-d728-43ab-8336-c48cf35b061e","expr":"result == null || result.getDeclaringClass() != null","rationale":"Java Method instances always have a non-null declaring class.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.MethodUtils#findOverriddenMethod(Method,Class<?>):Method","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/MethodUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-15T12:13:24.608684240Z"}
{"id":"50ec4148-d64c-418f-a0f3-cf013b77f6cb","expr":"result == null || result.getName().equals(overrider.getName())","rationale":"Overriding implies methods share name.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.MethodUtils#findOverriddenMethod(Method,Class<?>):Method","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/MethodUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-15T12:13:24.608684240Z"}
{"id":"1b09c7d7-79ca-44fd-a6be-e2b1a49697b8","expr":"result == null || result.getParameterCount() == overrider.getParameterCount()","rationale":"Overridden methods must have the same signature, including parameter count.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.MethodUtils#findOverriddenMethod(Method,Class<?>):Method","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/MethodUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-15T12:13:24.608684240Z"}
{"id":"dcd0ff4f-1f81-44f2-b873-adec044b5287","expr":"declaringClass != null","rationale":"The method is expected to operate on a non-null Class reference.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.MethodUtils#getAllDeclaredMethods(Class<?>,Predicate<Method>):List<Method>","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/MethodUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-15T12:13:24.956835196Z"}
{"id":"ba466893-4d17-497c-b791-45db41fe5573","expr":"methodsToFilter != null","rationale":"The varargs parameter methodsToFilter is always provided as an array (possibly empty) and not null.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.MethodUtils#getAllDeclaredMethods(Class<?>,Predicate<Method>):List<Method>","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/MethodUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-15T12:13:24.956835196Z"}
{"id":"10e1bf90-8136-4f99-86b4-5271a3de9522","expr":"methodsToFilter.getClass().isArray()","rationale":"methodsToFilter is a varargs Predicate array, so its runtime class is an array type.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.MethodUtils#getAllDeclaredMethods(Class<?>,Predicate<Method>):List<Method>","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/MethodUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-15T12:13:24.956835196Z"}
{"id":"5cb09a18-f119-4d7a-a572-079f264b270e","expr":"declaringClass != null","rationale":"The declaringClass must be non-null to retrieve methods safely.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.MethodUtils#getAllMethods(Class<?>,Predicate<Method>):List<Method>","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/MethodUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-15T12:13:26.350299769Z"}
{"id":"2ad5875e-2db6-4a73-9b8a-e5c94ecba2e9","expr":"methodsToFilter != null","rationale":"The methodsToFilter array may be empty but not null since it will be used to filter methods.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.MethodUtils#getAllMethods(Class<?>,Predicate<Method>):List<Method>","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/MethodUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-15T12:13:26.350299769Z"}
{"id":"bc9c284e-71f6-419d-9b38-5fa855202152","expr":"methodsToFilter.getClass().isArray()","rationale":"methodsToFilter is a vararg array of Predicate<Method>","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.MethodUtils#getAllMethods(Class<?>,Predicate<Method>):List<Method>","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/MethodUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-15T12:13:26.350299769Z"}
{"id":"8a7ac1c4-fdbd-4223-8336-8670b0c1c74c","expr":"method != null","rationale":"The method parameter should be non-null to properly invoke the method.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.MethodUtils#invokeAndReturnDouble(Method,Object):double","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/MethodUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-15T12:13:26.370583234Z"}
{"id":"85976244-ba77-427c-b52a-5a9a96c42999","expr":"targetObj == null || method.getDeclaringClass().isInstance(targetObj)","rationale":"Either the target object is null (for static methods) or is an instance of the declaring class.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.MethodUtils#invokeAndReturnDouble(Method,Object):double","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/MethodUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-15T12:13:26.370583234Z"}
{"id":"bf5eb1c2-31f6-44c1-8500-65c0e2958171","expr":"method.getParameterCount() == 0","rationale":"The method is invoked with no arguments (as seen in the code).","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.MethodUtils#invokeAndReturnDouble(Method,Object):double","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/MethodUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-15T12:13:26.370583234Z"}
{"id":"cb87c29d-cf44-4a8c-a4d1-bf4f9728599b","expr":"(! (method == null))","rationale":"Redundant null check that triggers alternate behavior in the method.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.MethodUtils#invokeAndReturnDouble(Method,Object):double","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/MethodUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-15T12:13:26.370583234Z"}
{"id":"c8882cf7-cda1-4d3c-8f66-7930b28bb1de","expr":"method == null || !Double.isNaN(result)","rationale":"When method is null, the method returns Double.NaN explicitly, otherwise it returns the invoked value cast to double.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.MethodUtils#invokeAndReturnDouble(Method,Object):double","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/MethodUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-15T12:13:26.390776610Z"}
{"id":"6ddac576-a1dc-4f8b-a26f-c8933fa3ad1e","expr":"Double.isNaN(result) || method != null","rationale":"Result is NaN only if method is null or invocation failed.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.MethodUtils#invokeAndReturnDouble(Method,Object):double","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/MethodUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-15T12:13:26.390776610Z"}
{"id":"2ddcd7e0-9860-4f32-8f6d-9c1394bf27fb","expr":"result == Double.NaN || (method != null && !Double.isNaN(result))","rationale":"Result is NaN exactly when invocation failed or method is null.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.MethodUtils#invokeAndReturnDouble(Method,Object):double","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/MethodUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-15T12:13:26.390776610Z"}
{"id":"c94aedcf-d86d-44bb-bfd6-9456bf846cd9","expr":"!Double.isNaN(result) || method == null","rationale":"Result is NaN only if method is null or invocation failed.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.MethodUtils#invokeAndReturnDouble(Method,Object):double","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/MethodUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-15T12:13:26.390776610Z"}
{"id":"a2ff0808-8bd7-4d43-9d0f-128bff8876cf","expr":"method != null || targetObj == null","rationale":"Since method.invoke(targetObj) is called only if method is not null, if method is null, targetObj's state does not affect execution.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.MethodUtils#invokeAndReturnLong(Method,Object):long","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/MethodUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-15T12:13:26.410523324Z"}
{"id":"65a0d974-2b1c-4813-8e4b-bf753a9d3042","expr":"method == null || method.getParameterCount() == 0","rationale":"The provided invoke call does not pass arguments, so method's parameter count should be zero when method is not null.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.MethodUtils#invokeAndReturnLong(Method,Object):long","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/MethodUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-15T12:13:26.410523324Z"}
{"id":"273a90b9-18bd-4f6c-a6af-ff59f4161023","expr":"targetObj != null || method == null","rationale":"If method is static, targetObj can be null; otherwise, it shouldn't be null when method is not null.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.MethodUtils#invokeAndReturnLong(Method,Object):long","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/MethodUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-15T12:13:26.410523324Z"}
{"id":"36e951d3-260f-4469-be54-ff22ec28b642","expr":"method == null || !method.isVarArgs()","rationale":"Because invoke is called with exactly one argument (targetObj) and no varargs, method should either be null or not a varargs method.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.MethodUtils#invokeAndReturnLong(Method,Object):long","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/MethodUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-15T12:13:26.410523324Z"}
