{"id":"21caa1c6-4800-4be4-8beb-36a658f9dc07","expr":"result.getParameterTypes()[0].isAssignableFrom(paramType)","rationale":"The returned constructor's single parameter type is assignable from paramType.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.ReflectUtils#findConstructor(Class<?>,Class<?>):Constructor<?>","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/ReflectUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-15T12:14:12.831377361Z"}
