{"id":"4250d2d2-8b6d-42d0-a74b-3fd515762df2","expr":"obj.getClass().getInterfaces().length >= 0","rationale":"The interfaces array length is naturally non-negative and used in a loop.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.ReflectUtils#isInstance(Object,String):boolean","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/ReflectUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-15T12:14:14.288205904Z"}
{"id":"b8b7dd5d-4a8b-40e9-b287-aac743be708c","expr":"returnType != null","rationale":"The returnType parameter must be non-null to determine the empty object to return.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.ReflectUtils#getEmptyObject(Class<?>):Object","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/ReflectUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-15T12:14:15.878827838Z"}
