{"id":"acb93a64-895d-4f56-96c6-7fb7b8b52736","expr":"result == null || classType.isPrimitive()","rationale":"Because primitiveDefaults maps primitive types, result non-null indicates primitive classType.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.ReflectUtils#defaultReturn(Class<?>):Object","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/ReflectUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-15T12:14:16.156764470Z"}
{"id":"de07a220-3c83-4dbf-91cc-f01854331633","expr":"result == null || returnType.isInstance(result)","rationale":"Since getEmptyObject returns an object representing an empty instance of returnType, result must be of type returnType or null if it cannot be instantiated.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.ReflectUtils#getEmptyObject(Class<?>):Object","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/ReflectUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-15T12:14:16.467165300Z"}
