{"id":"e62e8920-744e-4092-a695-9cbd022e69a7","expr":"!result || obj.getClass().isAssignableFrom(obj.getClass())","rationale":"If result is true, the object's class must be in a valid assignable state (trivially always true but contextually relevant)","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.ReflectUtils#isInstance(Object,String):boolean","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/ReflectUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-15T12:14:16.990151390Z"}
