{"id":"d1b54877-d957-468e-b472-2e70b87f316c","expr":"result == null || (result.length() > 0 && Character.isLowerCase(result.charAt(0)))","rationale":"The implementation calls toLowerCase() on the substring character at index 3 or 2, thus the first character of result is always lowercase if not null.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.ReflectUtils#getPropertyNameFromBeanReadMethod(Method):String","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/ReflectUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-15T12:14:21.048919331Z"}
{"id":"5ad27440-7b3a-4983-8aae-f215251fadfd","expr":"method != null && (result == null || !result.isEmpty())","rationale":"The substring calls guarantee non-empty strings if result is non-null.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.ReflectUtils#getPropertyNameFromBeanReadMethod(Method):String","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/ReflectUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-15T12:14:21.048919331Z"}
{"id":"3ed5c527-2c74-4ff7-9a98-793dc3e4c308","expr":"result == null || !result.isEmpty()","rationale":"Since the result is constructed using substring operations on method name which have minimum length requirements, it must be non-empty if it is not null.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.ReflectUtils#getPropertyNameFromBeanReadMethod(Method):String","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/ReflectUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-15T12:14:21.048919331Z"}
{"id":"04e3c15d-2e1b-403f-a93d-2261475e3b0a","expr":"!result || method != null","rationale":"The method is checked for null before returning true.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.ReflectUtils#isBeanPropertyWriteMethod(Method):boolean","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/ReflectUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-15T12:14:22.988938557Z"}
{"id":"7bdd093c-0b28-4d43-bc33-bdc5318f2721","expr":"!result || method.getParameterTypes().length == 1","rationale":"Setter methods conventionally have one parameter.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.ReflectUtils#isBeanPropertyWriteMethod(Method):boolean","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/ReflectUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-15T12:14:22.988938557Z"}
{"id":"b3a18288-a87e-4f56-9c58-be98e821fd51","expr":"method != null","rationale":"The method parameter should be a valid Method object, non-null, as the method getName() is called on it in the implementation.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.ReflectUtils#getPropertyNameFromBeanWriteMethod(Method):String","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/ReflectUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-15T12:14:23.086968683Z"}
{"id":"000b4ea0-651a-49e1-a1fa-02cc29f6582e","expr":"method.getName() != null","rationale":"Method.getName() never returns null; guaranteed by JDK specification.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.ReflectUtils#getPropertyNameFromBeanWriteMethod(Method):String","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/ReflectUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-15T12:14:23.086968683Z"}
{"id":"17bec5a6-0cc2-460a-af35-923901f8f442","expr":"method.getName().length() >= 4","rationale":"For a bean property write method named like 'setXyz', the length must be at least 4 to take substring(3,4) and substring(4).","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.ReflectUtils#getPropertyNameFromBeanWriteMethod(Method):String","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/ReflectUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-15T12:14:23.086968683Z"}
{"id":"afc67e22-2fbe-4513-9add-8656bf5b09e2","expr":"!method.getName().isEmpty()","rationale":"The method name is always non-empty because a Java method has a name string of length at least 1.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.ReflectUtils#getPropertyNameFromBeanWriteMethod(Method):String","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/ReflectUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-15T12:14:23.086968683Z"}
{"id":"09841cbb-5f9c-413b-becf-605dfd9d8ccb","expr":"field != null","rationale":"The method is static and operates on a Field parameter, so it is essential to consider that field must not be null for the method to behave correctly.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.ReflectUtils#isPublicInstanceField(Field):boolean","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/ReflectUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-15T12:14:23.986584670Z"}
{"id":"9ed41ee6-20a5-4c88-80ac-60471d9d9782","expr":"!field.isSynthetic()","rationale":"From the method body, isSynthetic being false is required for the return value to be true.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.ReflectUtils#isPublicInstanceField(Field):boolean","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/ReflectUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-15T12:14:23.986584670Z"}
{"id":"40b9445c-ea33-43bf-82a8-0ce78f82a762","expr":"!result || !field.isSynthetic()","rationale":"If the field is a public instance field, it must not be synthetic.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.ReflectUtils#isPublicInstanceField(Field):boolean","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/ReflectUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-15T12:14:25.217014658Z"}
{"id":"46d1c2d4-285e-4e4a-a83a-231b0369908b","expr":"result == null || (result.length() > 0 && Character.isLowerCase(result.charAt(0)))","rationale":"The method returns null if not a write method, otherwise returns a property name starting with lowercase.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.ReflectUtils#getPropertyNameFromBeanWriteMethod(Method):String","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/ReflectUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-15T12:14:25.537529268Z"}
{"id":"1a9af308-11b9-47d7-b81d-8a623db55a6f","expr":"result != null","rationale":"The method returns a Map initialized at the start, so the result cannot be null.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.ReflectUtils#getBeanPropertyFields(Class):Map<String, Field>","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/ReflectUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-15T12:14:26.320327662Z"}
{"id":"8cfd144a-04fc-4b53-9351-b066e850c2e3","expr":"(cl != null) || (result.isEmpty())","rationale":"If the input class is null or in superclass traversal reaches null, properties map would be returned empty.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.ReflectUtils#getBeanPropertyFields(Class):Map<String, Field>","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/ReflectUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-15T12:14:26.320327662Z"}
{"id":"28582359-cfe7-4b08-aa2b-563ed3c32df3","expr":"result.size() >= 0","rationale":"Size of the map can never be negative.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.ReflectUtils#getBeanPropertyFields(Class):Map<String, Field>","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/ReflectUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-15T12:14:26.320327662Z"}
{"id":"c0ac9927-992d-4f06-bb3a-a7a0f1817c2c","expr":"cl != null","rationale":"The method performs reflective operations on the provided Class object, so it must be non-null.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.ReflectUtils#getBeanPropertyReadMethods(Class):Map<String, Method>","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/ReflectUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-15T12:14:27.414209882Z"}
{"id":"700bde44-3716-4a8b-bcec-c6548edd6a2e","expr":"cl.isInterface() || !cl.isPrimitive()","rationale":"Primitive classes do not have methods typical to beans, so it's likely the Class is an interface or a non-primitive class.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.ReflectUtils#getBeanPropertyReadMethods(Class):Map<String, Method>","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/ReflectUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-15T12:14:27.414209882Z"}
{"id":"049bb4b2-0afb-4b84-bae1-95d4280023e6","expr":"cl.getName() != null","rationale":"The runtime Class object always has a valid name string, indicating that getName is always non-null.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.ReflectUtils#getBeanPropertyReadMethods(Class):Map<String, Method>","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/ReflectUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-15T12:14:27.414209882Z"}
{"id":"46fae038-b658-4beb-bb8e-951d58e681cf","expr":"cl.getDeclaredMethods().length >= 0","rationale":"Reflective method retrieval always returns a non-null array, possibly zero-length.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.ReflectUtils#getBeanPropertyReadMethods(Class):Map<String, Method>","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/ReflectUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-15T12:14:27.414209882Z"}
{"id":"afddc131-a16e-4fac-873b-53b7b6f85bbb","expr":"sourceClass != null","rationale":"The method operates on sourceClass to extract generic interfaces and superclass; thus, sourceClass must be non-null.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.ReflectUtils#findParameterizedTypes(Class<?>):Set<ParameterizedType>","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/ReflectUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-15T12:14:27.484342391Z"}
{"id":"da320c17-5552-46db-a545-487544170744","expr":"sourceClass.getGenericInterfaces() != null","rationale":"The getGenericInterfaces method of Class returns a non-null array even if there are no interfaces.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.ReflectUtils#findParameterizedTypes(Class<?>):Set<ParameterizedType>","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/ReflectUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-15T12:14:27.484342391Z"}
{"id":"43e48566-f4d1-4213-93f5-edfc80250df6","expr":"sourceClass.isInterface() || sourceClass.getSuperclass() != null","rationale":"Classes typically have superclass except for Object; interfaces return null for superclass.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.ReflectUtils#findParameterizedTypes(Class<?>):Set<ParameterizedType>","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/ReflectUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-15T12:14:27.484342391Z"}
{"id":"62a15d69-97e1-4722-8203-c98999ed3756","expr":"!sourceClass.isPrimitive()","rationale":"The method operates on class types to find parameterized types, which are typically not primitives.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.ReflectUtils#findParameterizedTypes(Class<?>):Set<ParameterizedType>","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/ReflectUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-15T12:14:27.484342391Z"}
{"id":"d88abcf4-c55d-40f5-a780-69379a3a53dc","expr":"result != null","rationale":"The method returns an unmodifiable set, which is never null.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.ReflectUtils#findParameterizedTypes(Class<?>):Set<ParameterizedType>","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/ReflectUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-15T12:14:27.550771475Z"}
{"id":"ce031dd9-e548-4949-bb81-2106a077da60","expr":"!result.isEmpty() || sourceClass.getGenericInterfaces().length == 0 || sourceClass.getGenericSuperclass() == null","rationale":"Result is empty only if no parameterized types found among interfaces or superclass.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.ReflectUtils#findParameterizedTypes(Class<?>):Set<ParameterizedType>","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/ReflectUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-15T12:14:27.550771475Z"}
{"id":"8924ae8c-6536-4883-9238-7de65e6f2941","expr":"result.size() <= sourceClass.getGenericInterfaces().length + (sourceClass.getGenericSuperclass() == null ? 0 : 1)","rationale":"The size of the result cannot exceed the total number of generic interfaces plus superclass, since result is direct parameterized types found.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.ReflectUtils#findParameterizedTypes(Class<?>):Set<ParameterizedType>","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/ReflectUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-15T12:14:27.550771475Z"}
{"id":"fce7dcd4-02ca-4b85-b92f-cd5fd4d8c4ea","expr":"sourceClass != null","rationale":"The method explicitly returns early if sourceClass is null, so it is non-null on entry.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.ReflectUtils#findHierarchicalTypes(Class<?>,Class<T>):Set<Class<T>>","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/ReflectUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-15T12:14:27.614995465Z"}
{"id":"bf73f376-1205-4134-82bd-d676ebe6419b","expr":"matchType != null","rationale":"The method calls matchType.isAssignableFrom(...) without a null check, so matchType must be non-null.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.ReflectUtils#findHierarchicalTypes(Class<?>,Class<T>):Set<Class<T>>","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/ReflectUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-15T12:14:27.614995465Z"}
{"id":"6d17f73d-45ec-4b74-a4a7-4b3ac5fada36","expr":"matchType.isAssignableFrom(sourceClass) || !matchType.isAssignableFrom(sourceClass)","rationale":"The method uses matchType.isAssignableFrom(sourceClass) in a conditional, so this predicate is meaningful at entry.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.ReflectUtils#findHierarchicalTypes(Class<?>,Class<T>):Set<Class<T>>","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/ReflectUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-15T12:14:27.614995465Z"}
{"id":"74654752-7ab3-4c41-8335-e35be1c4242d","expr":"sourceClass.getSuperclass() == null || sourceClass.getSuperclass() != null","rationale":"Superclass can be null (for Object) or non-null, so this invariant covers that.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.ReflectUtils#findHierarchicalTypes(Class<?>,Class<T>):Set<Class<T>>","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/ReflectUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-15T12:14:27.614995465Z"}
{"id":"a9725f81-ed23-4e4a-a4f4-45e44a5ab065","expr":"result != null","rationale":"The method always returns a non-null set because it either returns emptySet or an unmodifiable set.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.ReflectUtils#findHierarchicalTypes(Class<?>,Class<T>):Set<Class<T>>","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/ReflectUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-15T12:14:27.680299710Z"}
{"id":"ce4a5c5c-8dd9-4675-88c4-a404e82e1a60","expr":"sourceClass == null || result.contains(sourceClass.cast(sourceClass)) || !matchType.isAssignableFrom(sourceClass)","rationale":"If sourceClass is not null and matchType is assignable from sourceClass, then result contains sourceClass.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.ReflectUtils#findHierarchicalTypes(Class<?>,Class<T>):Set<Class<T>>","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/ReflectUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-15T12:14:27.680299710Z"}
{"id":"d03f7f05-99ec-4291-bdb4-e44198387a21","expr":"!result.isEmpty() || sourceClass == null","rationale":"If sourceClass is null, result is empty, otherwise it can be empty or non-empty.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.ReflectUtils#findHierarchicalTypes(Class<?>,Class<T>):Set<Class<T>>","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/ReflectUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-15T12:14:27.680299710Z"}
{"id":"86016401-d639-401a-9b12-6aefb7abd565","expr":"!result.contains(null)","rationale":"The method never adds null to the result set.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.ReflectUtils#findHierarchicalTypes(Class<?>,Class<T>):Set<Class<T>>","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/ReflectUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-15T12:14:27.680299710Z"}
{"id":"54958f3a-c593-40dd-9249-9b1b1fa155c9","expr":"bean != null && methodName != null && bean.getClass().getDeclaredMethods() != null","rationale":"bean is expected to be non-null to call getClass(); methodName is expected non-null for comparison with method names.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.ReflectUtils#getProperty(Object,String):T","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/ReflectUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-15T12:14:27.745280465Z"}
{"id":"14eaa81b-bbf7-4a46-9504-d8029cefb871","expr":"!methodName.isEmpty()","rationale":"methodName should typically be non-empty to be meaningful for property lookup.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.ReflectUtils#getProperty(Object,String):T","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/ReflectUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-15T12:14:27.745280465Z"}
{"id":"dbfee89e-9cf1-4fa6-8b16-186ad69b6680","expr":"!bean.getClass().isPrimitive()","rationale":"bean usually is an object, not a primitive type, for introspection.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.ReflectUtils#getProperty(Object,String):T","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/ReflectUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-15T12:14:27.745280465Z"}
{"id":"d1b969e9-2df8-4fe1-a83a-a1282aa30fb2","expr":"bean.getClass().getMethods().length > 0","rationale":"bean's class is expected to have at least one method.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.ReflectUtils#getProperty(Object,String):T","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/ReflectUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-15T12:14:27.745280465Z"}
{"id":"a24c47df-6b0b-46aa-b420-87731d95e3a9","expr":"result == null || true","rationale":"result may be null due to invocation failing or method absence.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.ReflectUtils#getProperty(Object,String):T","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/ReflectUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-15T12:14:27.811610943Z"}
{"id":"046f9687-f519-4c66-b3a9-47f81c2e548c","expr":"result == null || bean.getClass().getMethod(methodName) != null","rationale":"If result is non-null, the method corresponding to methodName should exist on the bean class.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.ReflectUtils#getProperty(Object,String):T","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/ReflectUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-15T12:14:27.811610943Z"}
