{"id":"a71dbe93-e1cd-4904-b080-20094e0b5768","expr":"methodName != null","rationale":"methodName needs to be non-null for meaningful equals comparison with methodDescriptor names","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.ReflectUtils#hasMethod(Class<?>,String):boolean","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/ReflectUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-15T12:14:27.876520064Z"}
{"id":"4d036d77-8197-45e3-b10a-f0eb95939bfa","expr":"!methodName.isEmpty()","rationale":"A method cannot have an empty name, so expecting methodName to be non-empty is reasonable","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.ReflectUtils#hasMethod(Class<?>,String):boolean","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/ReflectUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-15T12:14:27.876520064Z"}
{"id":"630e6276-11fb-4d67-8a82-d7105304d2ad","expr":"beanClass.isInterface() || beanClass.getDeclaredMethods().length > 0","rationale":"beanClass should either be an interface or have some declared methods for the method to be found","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.ReflectUtils#hasMethod(Class<?>,String):boolean","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/ReflectUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-15T12:14:27.876520064Z"}
{"id":"a2796471-a3ef-4b99-9a84-10c38dc4c8e5","expr":"methodName.equals(methodName.trim())","rationale":"Method names usually do not contain leading or trailing spaces, so methodName is likely trimmed","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.ReflectUtils#hasMethod(Class<?>,String):boolean","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/ReflectUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-15T12:14:27.876520064Z"}
{"id":"f59dda0b-a9be-4d86-9ba3-c75704344d15","expr":"!result || (beanClass != null && methodName != null)","rationale":"If a method with the given name exists, beanClass and methodName must not be null.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.ReflectUtils#hasMethod(Class<?>,String):boolean","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/ReflectUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-15T12:14:27.942237567Z"}
{"id":"ddb1a9be-acae-4fd2-b289-4fee826e5b6e","expr":"!result || methodName.length() > 0","rationale":"If the method exists, the methodName string is non-empty.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.ReflectUtils#hasMethod(Class<?>,String):boolean","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/ReflectUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-15T12:14:27.942237567Z"}
{"id":"c95f9fe1-61f4-400d-9c36-98b0e82c321d","expr":"result != null","rationale":"The result map is always initialized with a new HashMap instance before returning.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.ReflectUtils#getBeanPropertyReadMethods(Class):Map<String, Method>","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/ReflectUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-15T12:14:28.885133335Z"}
{"id":"7bd814d6-d5fa-495a-9a8c-214fb6ea82b9","expr":"cl == null || cl.getDeclaredFields() != null","rationale":"For a non-null Class, getDeclaredFields returns a non-null array.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.ReflectUtils#getBeanPropertyFields(Class):Map<String, Field>","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/ReflectUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-15T12:14:29.375440781Z"}
{"id":"fb24bf0d-9b8c-49c2-b39d-52e716a472c0","expr":"cl == null || cl.getName() != null","rationale":"Class name is always defined for non-null cl.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.ReflectUtils#getBeanPropertyFields(Class):Map<String, Field>","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/ReflectUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-15T12:14:29.375440781Z"}
{"id":"f4ae7c03-f0ee-47e3-a46a-75cbb22e3f26","expr":"cl == null || cl.isInterface() == false","rationale":"Usually cl is a concrete class, not an interface.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.ReflectUtils#getBeanPropertyFields(Class):Map<String, Field>","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/ReflectUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-15T12:14:29.375440781Z"}
