{"id":"c8a66ef5-b7e5-4555-b406-6b62e3e6cf0e","expr":"!className.contains(\" \")","rationale":"A valid fully qualified class name does not include whitespace characters.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.DefaultSerializeClassChecker#loadClass(ClassLoader,String):Class<?>","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/DefaultSerializeClassChecker.java","createdAt":"2026-09-15T12:14:34.099900388Z"}
{"id":"e52308cd-b52d-4deb-b282-47683f16b0cc","expr":"result != null","rationale":"The method returns a loaded class object for the given className and classLoader.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.DefaultSerializeClassChecker#loadClass(ClassLoader,String):Class<?>","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/DefaultSerializeClassChecker.java","createdAt":"2026-09-15T12:14:34.103663115Z"}
{"id":"4055d770-b744-4df1-8d85-1d3b749ced66","expr":"result.getClassLoader() == classLoader || (classLoader == null && result.getClassLoader() == null)","rationale":"The loaded class's class loader must be the input classLoader if it is not null.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.DefaultSerializeClassChecker#loadClass(ClassLoader,String):Class<?>","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/DefaultSerializeClassChecker.java","createdAt":"2026-09-15T12:14:34.103663115Z"}
{"id":"70b9e594-f3d2-4e9e-809d-ff719efe2b04","expr":"className != null && !className.isEmpty()","rationale":"The method processes each character of className, so it is valid only if className is non-empty.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.DefaultSerializeClassChecker#loadClass0(ClassLoader,String):Class<?>","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/DefaultSerializeClassChecker.java","createdAt":"2026-09-15T12:14:34.105167438Z"}
{"id":"110f614d-491d-43c3-a163-f015067e4606","expr":"className.indexOf('$') >= -1","rationale":"No explicit restriction on '$' presence, so it's valid at the method entry.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.DefaultSerializeClassChecker#loadClass0(ClassLoader,String):Class<?>","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/DefaultSerializeClassChecker.java","createdAt":"2026-09-15T12:14:34.105167438Z"}
{"id":"cb2e1b75-ce94-400a-a4b3-3b470f55b222","expr":"className.length() >= 0","rationale":"Ensures safe iteration over className characters.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.DefaultSerializeClassChecker#loadClass0(ClassLoader,String):Class<?>","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/DefaultSerializeClassChecker.java","createdAt":"2026-09-15T12:14:34.105167438Z"}
{"id":"465f11e1-dfd0-472b-b5d3-2ec30f5f5b81","expr":"className.equals(className.trim())","rationale":"Class names typically do not contain leading or trailing whitespace.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.DefaultSerializeClassChecker#loadClass0(ClassLoader,String):Class<?>","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/DefaultSerializeClassChecker.java","createdAt":"2026-09-15T12:14:34.105167438Z"}
{"id":"36bb762e-54e1-4077-a3e4-6a3266b42e7a","expr":"className != null","rationale":"The className is expected to be non-null since it will be used to load a class either via classHolder or ClassUtils.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.DefaultSerializeClassChecker#classForName(ClassLoader,String):Class<?>","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/DefaultSerializeClassChecker.java","createdAt":"2026-09-15T12:14:34.105828363Z"}
{"id":"fa3dc740-d298-4048-b9c0-71a5b5e55e31","expr":"!className.isEmpty()","rationale":"A class name used for class loading shouldn't be an empty string.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.DefaultSerializeClassChecker#classForName(ClassLoader,String):Class<?>","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/DefaultSerializeClassChecker.java","createdAt":"2026-09-15T12:14:34.105828363Z"}
{"id":"e0bc829a-c627-4f97-b020-e4f29a20b10c","expr":"(classLoader == null) || (classLoader.getClass() != null)","rationale":"The classLoader parameter may be null or a valid ClassLoader instance; it is type-safe to check for null and used in forName call.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.DefaultSerializeClassChecker#classForName(ClassLoader,String):Class<?>","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/DefaultSerializeClassChecker.java","createdAt":"2026-09-15T12:14:34.105828363Z"}
{"id":"33ea9cbb-601e-4a51-9288-ccd661846d04","expr":"(classLoader == null) || (classLoader.getClass().getClassLoader() != null)","rationale":"Some invariants about class loader hierarchy may hold; this ensures classLoader is a properly initialized class loader or null.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.DefaultSerializeClassChecker#classForName(ClassLoader,String):Class<?>","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/DefaultSerializeClassChecker.java","createdAt":"2026-09-15T12:14:34.105828363Z"}
{"id":"efd86cd8-a904-49e7-9769-b7e98154ee94","expr":"result != null","rationale":"Since the method returns a Class<?> loaded by the given classLoader and className, the result should never be null, assuming no exception is thrown.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.DefaultSerializeClassChecker#classForName(ClassLoader,String):Class<?>","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/DefaultSerializeClassChecker.java","createdAt":"2026-09-15T12:14:34.111087600Z"}
{"id":"9b84bda9-5d48-426b-b0bb-224f77e68d65","expr":"(classLoader == null) || (result.getClassLoader() == classLoader)","rationale":"The method uses classLoader to load the class if classHolder is null, so the returned class should be associated with the classLoader if it is not null.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.DefaultSerializeClassChecker#classForName(ClassLoader,String):Class<?>","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/DefaultSerializeClassChecker.java","createdAt":"2026-09-15T12:14:34.111087600Z"}
{"id":"bfb9a18c-d175-480c-a7f9-127ece6ff2d1","expr":"className.equals(result.getName())","rationale":"The method loads the class with the given className, so the returned Class object's name should match className.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.DefaultSerializeClassChecker#classForName(ClassLoader,String):Class<?>","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/DefaultSerializeClassChecker.java","createdAt":"2026-09-15T12:14:34.111087600Z"}
{"id":"1d9c8419-9534-4cd8-922a-b94802483eac","expr":"(classLoader == null) || (classLoader.getParent() == null || classLoader == result.getClassLoader() || classLoader.getParent() == result.getClassLoader())","rationale":"Class loading often involves delegation to parent class loaders, so the result's class loader could be the same as classLoader or its parent.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.DefaultSerializeClassChecker#classForName(ClassLoader,String):Class<?>","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/DefaultSerializeClassChecker.java","createdAt":"2026-09-15T12:14:34.111087600Z"}
{"id":"289cc77e-d20a-4954-9b3b-14f83969d734","expr":"result != null","rationale":"Since loadClass0 either returns a valid Class object or throws an exception, the result is not null here.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.DefaultSerializeClassChecker#loadClass0(ClassLoader,String):Class<?>","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/DefaultSerializeClassChecker.java","createdAt":"2026-09-15T12:14:34.123026938Z"}
{"id":"bbb70ef9-47e1-4d5e-9d15-2288b77183b4","expr":"result.getName().equals(className)","rationale":"The method is meant to load the Class for className, so the returned Class's name should equal className.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.DefaultSerializeClassChecker#loadClass0(ClassLoader,String):Class<?>","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/DefaultSerializeClassChecker.java","createdAt":"2026-09-15T12:14:34.123026938Z"}
{"id":"2c3dfa77-ffd7-44f8-b744-ff5843f4c43b","expr":"method.getName() != null","rationale":"method name must be non-null for invocation logic","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.PojoInvocationHandler#invoke(Object,Method,Object[]):Object","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/PojoUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-15T12:14:34.148835290Z"}
{"id":"2e918975-b477-43c5-95a8-233071934f1a","expr":"args.length >= 0","rationale":"args is an array, and array length is always non-negative","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.PojoInvocationHandler#invoke(Object,Method,Object[]):Object","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/PojoUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-15T12:14:34.148835290Z"}
{"id":"da24b0b8-c3bc-45f7-bc0a-6f1f2a8085f4","expr":"method.getDeclaringClass() != null","rationale":"the declaring class must be non-null to perform class level checks","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.PojoInvocationHandler#invoke(Object,Method,Object[]):Object","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/PojoUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-15T12:14:34.148835290Z"}
{"id":"0334c7f1-4fbb-4f8d-9ba9-7412e2fad509","expr":"!method.getName().isEmpty()","rationale":"method must have a non-empty name for the method invocation logic","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.PojoInvocationHandler#invoke(Object,Method,Object[]):Object","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/PojoUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-15T12:14:34.148835290Z"}
{"id":"9bffd332-201c-4360-9993-ab8339864d7b","expr":"logger != null && logger.isTraceEnabled() == (throwable != null || true)","rationale":"logger.isTraceEnabled() implies the method trace is called with throwable","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.LogHelper#trace(Logger,Throwable):void","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/LogHelper.java","createdAt":"2026-09-15T12:14:36.706472661Z"}
{"id":"eabf4f73-d43d-408d-91ea-5c559171c136","expr":"logger == null || logger.isTraceEnabled() || !logger.isTraceEnabled()","rationale":"logger is either null or its isTraceEnabled method returns true or false","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.LogHelper#trace(Logger,Throwable):void","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/LogHelper.java","createdAt":"2026-09-15T12:14:36.706472661Z"}
{"id":"5a2b0dab-8dcf-44a0-8958-f7ae51ae9480","expr":"logger == null || !logger.isTraceEnabled() || throwable != null || throwable == null","rationale":"No constraint on throwable when trace is enabled or not","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.LogHelper#trace(Logger,Throwable):void","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/LogHelper.java","createdAt":"2026-09-15T12:14:36.706472661Z"}
{"id":"1876cfd8-b985-4d49-8390-3b40efa21470","expr":"logger != null","rationale":"logger is null only when method returns immediately at the top","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.LogHelper#trace(Logger,Throwable):void","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/LogHelper.java","createdAt":"2026-09-15T12:14:36.706472661Z"}
{"id":"7e095e90-6079-48af-9836-65077dd6b08b","expr":"!(logger == null && logger.isTraceEnabled())","rationale":"logger must be non-null to call isTraceEnabled","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.LogHelper#trace(Logger,Throwable):void","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/LogHelper.java","createdAt":"2026-09-15T12:14:36.706472661Z"}
{"id":"5d3120d4-6bf6-4c82-b96f-9d361bcdee57","expr":"logger != null","rationale":"The method immediately returns if logger is null, so we can assume logger is not null here.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.LogHelper#trace(Logger,Throwable):void","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/LogHelper.java","createdAt":"2026-09-15T12:14:36.811470632Z"}
{"id":"810d7a92-adee-41c4-bc05-92adfcf6a8e2","expr":"logger.isTraceEnabled() || throwable == null","rationale":"Either trace logging is enabled or throwable might not be used.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.LogHelper#trace(Logger,Throwable):void","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/LogHelper.java","createdAt":"2026-09-15T12:14:36.811470632Z"}
{"id":"ddb1d1e4-a582-4c06-9628-c0dbc02b8a7d","expr":"throwable == null || logger.isTraceEnabled()","rationale":"Throwable is passed to logger.trace only if trace is enabled, so if throwable is non-null, trace must be enabled.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.LogHelper#trace(Logger,Throwable):void","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/LogHelper.java","createdAt":"2026-09-15T12:14:36.811470632Z"}
{"id":"09c2ed5e-e8db-4c34-9b3b-3dd755f3c4e7","expr":"logger.isTraceEnabled() == (logger != null && logger.isTraceEnabled())","rationale":"logger.isTraceEnabled() can be checked safely because logger is not null.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.LogHelper#trace(Logger,Throwable):void","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/LogHelper.java","createdAt":"2026-09-15T12:14:36.811470632Z"}
{"id":"4fb437c0-d3e6-4377-aaf0-fcf479a20a65","expr":"logger != null","rationale":"The first check in method is if logger is null, then return.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.LogHelper#trace(Logger,String,Throwable):void","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/LogHelper.java","createdAt":"2026-09-15T12:14:36.813165254Z"}
{"id":"ad2c4514-31dc-4952-913d-52dc044baa39","expr":"logger.getName() != null","rationale":"Logger instances generally have a non-null name.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.LogHelper#trace(Logger,String,Throwable):void","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/LogHelper.java","createdAt":"2026-09-15T12:14:36.813165254Z"}
{"id":"135f8bb6-d0d8-4eec-8c6d-18a7f50873ea","expr":"logger == null || !logger.isTraceEnabled() || logger.isTraceEnabled()","rationale":"Logical disjunction to capture that at method exit the control flow reflects trace enabled or not.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.LogHelper#trace(Logger,String):void","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/LogHelper.java","createdAt":"2026-09-15T12:14:36.847055248Z"}
{"id":"0fce10eb-52bd-4178-81d2-9c6df8e9d65b","expr":"logger == null || (logger.isTraceEnabled() || !logger.isTraceEnabled())","rationale":"logger.isTraceEnabled() can only be true or false.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.LogHelper#trace(Logger,String):void","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/LogHelper.java","createdAt":"2026-09-15T12:14:36.847055248Z"}
{"id":"0cd03d38-4e48-4608-83b7-98055bead84a","expr":"logger == null || logger.isTraceEnabled() == (logger.isTraceEnabled())","rationale":"Consistency of isTraceEnabled across the method execution.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.LogHelper#trace(Logger,String):void","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/LogHelper.java","createdAt":"2026-09-15T12:14:36.847055248Z"}
{"id":"3e6aaaaf-8a39-4cf4-8016-39a067eb843e","expr":"logger != null","rationale":"The method returns immediately if logger is null, so at method exit if there were calls to trace, logger cannot be null.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.LogHelper#trace(Logger,String):void","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/LogHelper.java","createdAt":"2026-09-15T12:14:36.847055248Z"}
{"id":"8c50689a-06df-4b44-ad80-ff1fb06b1edf","expr":"logger != null","rationale":"The method returns immediately if logger is null, so logger is expected to be non-null after this check.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.LogHelper#trace(Logger,String):void","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/LogHelper.java","createdAt":"2026-09-15T12:14:37.032767399Z"}
{"id":"82ec5e59-8934-481d-b62d-908e0d2213bd","expr":"!logger.isTraceEnabled() || (msg != null || msg == null)","rationale":"If tracing is enabled, the trace method is called with msg, which can be null or non-null.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.LogHelper#trace(Logger,String):void","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/LogHelper.java","createdAt":"2026-09-15T12:14:37.032767399Z"}
{"id":"654b4122-6408-4a29-bb69-b0c349d8704a","expr":"!(logger == null) || (logger.isTraceEnabled() == false)","rationale":"If logger is null, the method returns early; otherwise, whether trace is enabled can affect flow.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.LogHelper#trace(Logger,String):void","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/LogHelper.java","createdAt":"2026-09-15T12:14:37.032767399Z"}
{"id":"f43c65fd-7d8f-442f-8215-f52350730a14","expr":"logger != null","rationale":"The method returns immediately if the logger parameter is null, therefore at method exit logger is always non-null.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.LogHelper#debug(Logger,String):void","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/LogHelper.java","createdAt":"2026-09-15T12:14:38.810612409Z"}
{"id":"d30a303f-a2fb-403e-8837-d356da0b7236","expr":"!logger.isDebugEnabled() || (msg == null || logger.isDebugEnabled())","rationale":"If debug() method was invoked, then logger.isDebugEnabled() must be true; otherwise, the debug call is not executed.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.LogHelper#debug(Logger,String):void","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/LogHelper.java","createdAt":"2026-09-15T12:14:38.810612409Z"}
{"id":"3c613c43-ff8b-4c1e-be1b-347434885808","expr":"logger != null","rationale":"At method entry, logger could be null or non-null; checking for non-null allows calling methods safely.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.LogHelper#debug(Logger,String):void","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/LogHelper.java","createdAt":"2026-09-15T12:14:40.108411621Z"}
{"id":"e957d27c-c3c1-40e4-a1b6-20918f10e78e","expr":"!logger.isDebugEnabled() || (logger != null)","rationale":"Call to isDebugEnabled() requires a non-null logger; thus, if that call returns a value, logger must be non-null.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.LogHelper#debug(Logger,String):void","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/LogHelper.java","createdAt":"2026-09-15T12:14:40.108411621Z"}
{"id":"e86a7cbb-52f7-4fd6-8ec5-d6269d0114fa","expr":"logger.isDebugEnabled() == false || (logger.isDebugEnabled() == true)","rationale":"This is a tautological assertion of the type of isDebugEnabled() but is included for clarity of method return type.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.LogHelper#debug(Logger,String):void","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/LogHelper.java","createdAt":"2026-09-15T12:14:40.108411621Z"}
{"id":"9fc84461-b15b-412a-bf7c-a2132c24327a","expr":"msg == null || msg.length() >= 0","rationale":"Ensures that if msg is present, it has a valid string length.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.LogHelper#debug(Logger,String):void","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/LogHelper.java","createdAt":"2026-09-15T12:14:40.108411621Z"}
{"id":"8c8ef053-70d6-4e94-b8ac-e44ef92e545a","expr":"logger != null","rationale":"The method returns immediately if logger is null, so it is always non-null beyond this check.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.LogHelper#debug(Logger,Throwable):void","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/LogHelper.java","createdAt":"2026-09-15T12:14:40.278110430Z"}
{"id":"0c657057-1394-414e-8b31-261791095ff2","expr":"logger.isDebugEnabled() == false || e != null","rationale":"If debug is enabled, e can be logged; else, no logging occurs.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.LogHelper#debug(Logger,Throwable):void","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/LogHelper.java","createdAt":"2026-09-15T12:14:40.278110430Z"}
{"id":"573bbbd0-7082-4e93-a8ec-8a77b8afde03","expr":"logger.isDebugEnabled() || e == null","rationale":"Logging occurs only if debug is enabled, so e being passed is meaningful only then.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.LogHelper#debug(Logger,Throwable):void","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/LogHelper.java","createdAt":"2026-09-15T12:14:40.278110430Z"}
{"id":"2fdb051f-f089-4a11-a6d0-b73a039901b0","expr":"logger.isDebugEnabled() == true || logger.isDebugEnabled() == false","rationale":"logger.isDebugEnabled() is a boolean predicate.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.LogHelper#debug(Logger,Throwable):void","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/LogHelper.java","createdAt":"2026-09-15T12:14:40.278110430Z"}
{"id":"7cd2aae5-078e-4383-82c4-8d70bd4896f8","expr":"logger != null","rationale":"logger must not be null since the method returns early if logger is null","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.LogHelper#trace(Logger,String,Throwable):void","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/LogHelper.java","createdAt":"2026-09-15T12:14:40.296696588Z"}
{"id":"922daa59-f118-4c6f-9818-871bc3816483","expr":"!logger.isTraceEnabled() || (msg != null || true)","rationale":"If trace is enabled, logger.trace is called with msg and e; msg can be null but is passed","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.LogHelper#trace(Logger,String,Throwable):void","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/LogHelper.java","createdAt":"2026-09-15T12:14:40.296696588Z"}
{"id":"fe3db977-382f-40ed-92a2-94f41948f4af","expr":"!logger.isTraceEnabled() || e != null || true","rationale":"If trace is enabled, e is passed to logger.trace, but e may be null","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.LogHelper#trace(Logger,String,Throwable):void","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/LogHelper.java","createdAt":"2026-09-15T12:14:40.296696588Z"}
{"id":"ca7963ea-1c04-4120-958a-fcc1fa342dd0","expr":"logger.isTraceEnabled() == false || logger.isTraceEnabled() == true","rationale":"logger.isTraceEnabled() returns a boolean, always true or false","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.LogHelper#trace(Logger,String,Throwable):void","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/LogHelper.java","createdAt":"2026-09-15T12:14:40.296696588Z"}
{"id":"ec0fca0d-da31-4f7d-9eab-7e720beba767","expr":"logger != null","rationale":"Since the method returns immediately if logger is null, at this return point logger must be non-null.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.LogHelper#debug(Logger,Throwable):void","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/LogHelper.java","createdAt":"2026-09-15T12:14:40.625614978Z"}
{"id":"30c87c0d-6bb1-467b-9b14-78b9876d452f","expr":"logger.isDebugEnabled() || e == null || true","rationale":"If debug is enabled, the method calls debug on logger with e; otherwise no call is done.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.LogHelper#debug(Logger,Throwable):void","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/LogHelper.java","createdAt":"2026-09-15T12:14:40.625614978Z"}
{"id":"63981879-b374-4d1b-9a21-e01d7f9cb079","expr":"!logger.isDebugEnabled() || e != null || true","rationale":"Method calls logger.debug(e) only if logger.isDebugEnabled() is true, so if debug enabled, debug is called with e.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.LogHelper#debug(Logger,Throwable):void","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/LogHelper.java","createdAt":"2026-09-15T12:14:40.625614978Z"}
{"id":"e8f0c576-720f-4cb2-901e-d8f134505815","expr":"logger != null && (logger.isDebugEnabled() || true)","rationale":"Logger object is never null at this point, and debug is called if and only if debug is enabled.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.LogHelper#debug(Logger,Throwable):void","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/LogHelper.java","createdAt":"2026-09-15T12:14:40.625614978Z"}
{"id":"c9bb8ae8-7f98-47e6-9b5f-6c27784abe9b","expr":"logger != null && (e == null || true)","rationale":"There is no constraint on the nullness of e at method exit; e may be null or non-null.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.LogHelper#debug(Logger,Throwable):void","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/LogHelper.java","createdAt":"2026-09-15T12:14:40.625614978Z"}
{"id":"e6093fe8-a3b9-4abe-a5ee-d2750b5bcad3","expr":"logger != null","rationale":"The logger must be non-null to proceed with debugging.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.LogHelper#debug(Logger,String,Throwable):void","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/LogHelper.java","createdAt":"2026-09-15T12:14:42.143387344Z"}
{"id":"114b322d-8f3f-4aa1-a197-b55e07699867","expr":"!logger.isDebugEnabled() || (msg != null || e != null)","rationale":"If debug logging is enabled, there is usually something to log either a message or a throwable.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.LogHelper#debug(Logger,String,Throwable):void","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/LogHelper.java","createdAt":"2026-09-15T12:14:42.143387344Z"}
{"id":"7d039024-c059-4710-9355-ba3c3f104c64","expr":"logger.isDebugEnabled() == (logger != null && logger.isDebugEnabled())","rationale":"logger.isDebugEnabled() can only be true if logger is non-null.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.LogHelper#debug(Logger,String,Throwable):void","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/LogHelper.java","createdAt":"2026-09-15T12:14:42.143387344Z"}
{"id":"2d4039a3-7c5d-4503-9cff-933947f92a8a","expr":"logger != null","rationale":"The method returns immediately if logger is null, so logger being non-null is a key precondition.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.LogHelper#info(Logger,String):void","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/LogHelper.java","createdAt":"2026-09-15T12:14:42.709209939Z"}
{"id":"b4870771-e87f-40d8-8bf8-9da5b8e1685e","expr":"!logger.isInfoEnabled() || msg != null","rationale":"If info logging is enabled, msg is passed to logger.info(msg), so msg is expected not to be null in this scenario.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.LogHelper#info(Logger,String):void","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/LogHelper.java","createdAt":"2026-09-15T12:14:42.709209939Z"}
{"id":"96ebf883-2a61-4e3f-a4fc-7da181cc88aa","expr":"msg == null || msg.length() >= 0","rationale":"If msg is not null, its length is non-negative.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.LogHelper#info(Logger,String):void","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/LogHelper.java","createdAt":"2026-09-15T12:14:42.709209939Z"}
{"id":"d3545bea-f103-4e6c-b38b-e4ed2515ea53","expr":"logger.isInfoEnabled() == false || logger.isInfoEnabled() == true","rationale":"The isInfoEnabled() method returns a boolean value.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.LogHelper#info(Logger,String):void","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/LogHelper.java","createdAt":"2026-09-15T12:14:42.709209939Z"}
{"id":"e1b941ac-8c57-4706-ab38-ac1e97580d72","expr":"logger != null || (logger == null)","rationale":"Logger is either null (early return) or non-null (proceeded to check enabled).","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.LogHelper#info(Logger,String):void","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/LogHelper.java","createdAt":"2026-09-15T12:14:43.043992524Z"}
{"id":"24b99556-259b-49e4-95f4-ae2947526421","expr":"!logger.isInfoEnabled() || msg != null || msg == null","rationale":"msg can be null or non-null regardless of info enabled state.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.LogHelper#info(Logger,String):void","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/LogHelper.java","createdAt":"2026-09-15T12:14:43.043992524Z"}
{"id":"d8666c1b-254f-483e-a50c-a187b9972096","expr":"logger != null","rationale":"If method did not return early, logger is definitely non-null.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.LogHelper#info(Logger,String):void","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/LogHelper.java","createdAt":"2026-09-15T12:14:43.043992524Z"}
{"id":"78005125-f5f7-4a09-bcf6-0edf3c4fb0cd","expr":"logger != null","rationale":"Method returns if logger is null, so logger is non-null for subsequent calls.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.LogHelper#info(Logger,Throwable):void","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/LogHelper.java","createdAt":"2026-09-15T12:14:43.453348053Z"}
{"id":"07e0919f-95d5-43ac-8394-9acf183cc6b8","expr":"logger.isInfoEnabled() == (logger != null && logger.isInfoEnabled())","rationale":"Ensures that isInfoEnabled() call is relevant only when logger is non-null.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.LogHelper#info(Logger,Throwable):void","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/LogHelper.java","createdAt":"2026-09-15T12:14:43.453348053Z"}
{"id":"f0914067-ef99-4a2e-8759-7888114a3cb0","expr":"logger != null && (!logger.isInfoEnabled() || e != null)","rationale":"The method logs e only if logger has info logging enabled, implying if info is enabled, e should be a meaningful Throwable.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.LogHelper#info(Logger,Throwable):void","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/LogHelper.java","createdAt":"2026-09-15T12:14:43.914552602Z"}
{"id":"4d39cf93-dd13-41ca-ac68-1b9728c30028","expr":"logger != null","rationale":"Because if logger was null, the method returns early, logger is guaranteed non-null at this program point.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.LogHelper#info(Logger,Throwable):void","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/LogHelper.java","createdAt":"2026-09-15T12:14:43.914552602Z"}
{"id":"43c1b864-a45c-48b8-8ba2-05cb439db5f5","expr":"logger != null","rationale":"The method returns early if logger is null, so at method exit logger is guaranteed non-null.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.LogHelper#debug(Logger,String,Throwable):void","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/LogHelper.java","createdAt":"2026-09-15T12:14:43.980389761Z"}
{"id":"ea08ead8-3e48-4d0a-9802-24efa5a7d716","expr":"!logger.isDebugEnabled() || msg != null","rationale":"If debug is enabled, logger.debug is called with msg, so msg should be non-null or at least evaluated.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.LogHelper#debug(Logger,String,Throwable):void","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/LogHelper.java","createdAt":"2026-09-15T12:14:43.980389761Z"}
{"id":"97e775a0-f5dd-4bc3-88b5-8a7f8da2078c","expr":"logger != null","rationale":"The method returns immediately if logger is null, so at the entry point, logger should be non-null for useful warning","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.LogHelper#warn(Logger,String,Throwable):void","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/LogHelper.java","createdAt":"2026-09-15T12:14:46.425206667Z"}
{"id":"fa1910aa-f7da-4ab2-a847-f92d9b5ac404","expr":"msg != null || msg == null","rationale":"No explicit check or constraint on msg nullness, can be null","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.LogHelper#warn(Logger,String,Throwable):void","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/LogHelper.java","createdAt":"2026-09-15T12:14:46.425206667Z"}
{"id":"e1c35748-712a-4a56-a218-64c7dfb75383","expr":"(!logger.isWarnEnabled()) || true","rationale":"logger.isWarnEnabled() can be true or false, method uses it to decide whether to warn","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.LogHelper#warn(Logger,String,Throwable):void","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/LogHelper.java","createdAt":"2026-09-15T12:14:46.425206667Z"}
{"id":"93c96b43-391e-494b-adbf-a0d52e82c3bf","expr":"e == null || msg != null","rationale":"It's common to provide a message with an exception but not enforced","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.LogHelper#warn(Logger,String,Throwable):void","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/LogHelper.java","createdAt":"2026-09-15T12:14:46.425206667Z"}
{"id":"ac803783-4de4-4c0e-a34a-c97154073ae4","expr":"logger != null","rationale":"The method returns early if logger is null, so before method exit logger must be non-null.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.LogHelper#info(Logger,String,Throwable):void","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/LogHelper.java","createdAt":"2026-09-15T12:14:46.604523773Z"}
{"id":"3106cd78-c274-4742-b311-96051c7fa9c3","expr":"!logger.isInfoEnabled() || (msg != null || e != null)","rationale":"If the logger info level is enabled, the method attempts to log msg and e. So either logging is disabled or parameters may be null.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.LogHelper#info(Logger,String,Throwable):void","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/LogHelper.java","createdAt":"2026-09-15T12:14:46.604523773Z"}
{"id":"ad640b00-670c-42f6-88c8-dc898685d70e","expr":"logger != null","rationale":"The method returns if logger is null, so at this point logger must be non-null.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.LogHelper#warn(Logger,String,Throwable):void","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/LogHelper.java","createdAt":"2026-09-15T12:14:47.284863989Z"}
{"id":"6f4da130-5276-4fda-ac3b-bbb886ae0859","expr":"logger.isWarnEnabled()","rationale":"The method only calls logger.warn if logger.isWarnEnabled() is true; thus at exit, it must be true.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.LogHelper#warn(Logger,String,Throwable):void","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/LogHelper.java","createdAt":"2026-09-15T12:14:47.284863989Z"}
{"id":"491ac08e-04c7-43a0-b1fa-c50eba3bb6f1","expr":"msg == null || logger.isWarnEnabled()","rationale":"Though msg may be null, logging occurs only if warning is enabled.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.LogHelper#warn(Logger,String,Throwable):void","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/LogHelper.java","createdAt":"2026-09-15T12:14:47.284863989Z"}
{"id":"521da6a0-1302-44fc-b834-513c99e58699","expr":"e == null || logger.isWarnEnabled()","rationale":"If an exception e is provided, warn is only called when isWarnEnabled() returns true.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.LogHelper#warn(Logger,String,Throwable):void","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/LogHelper.java","createdAt":"2026-09-15T12:14:47.284863989Z"}
{"id":"ba7689f2-1faa-4368-9099-489a98dd2514","expr":"logger != null && logger.isWarnEnabled()","rationale":"After the checks, logger must be non-null and warning enabled to have proceeded to invoke warn.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.LogHelper#warn(Logger,String,Throwable):void","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/LogHelper.java","createdAt":"2026-09-15T12:14:47.284863989Z"}
{"id":"babc8e0e-597c-49b2-bcca-d902f210f4ea","expr":"logger != null","rationale":"The method checks if logger is null and returns immediately, so at METHOD_ENTRY logger is expected to be non-null.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.LogHelper#info(Logger,String,Throwable):void","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/LogHelper.java","createdAt":"2026-09-15T12:14:47.332285621Z"}
{"id":"4e4c0367-7af3-445e-ae1e-39748db8cb01","expr":"msg != null || msg == null","rationale":"No null checks for msg are done, so msg may be null or not.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.LogHelper#info(Logger,String,Throwable):void","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/LogHelper.java","createdAt":"2026-09-15T12:14:47.332285621Z"}
{"id":"f3d53ae6-c809-4f99-9aa9-5f8c0d49a641","expr":"!logger.isInfoEnabled() || (logger.isInfoEnabled() && logger != null)","rationale":"If logger.isInfoEnabled() returns true then logger is not null already.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.LogHelper#info(Logger,String,Throwable):void","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/LogHelper.java","createdAt":"2026-09-15T12:14:47.332285621Z"}
{"id":"43e545a5-1798-4f6a-bf05-be3ba4fefb8b","expr":"(!logger.isInfoEnabled() || msg != null)","rationale":"If info level is enabled, the msg can be either null or non-null, allowing info to be logged with msg.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.LogHelper#info(Logger,String,Throwable):void","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/LogHelper.java","createdAt":"2026-09-15T12:14:47.332285621Z"}
{"id":"4726ef3f-4007-41b8-a411-766c3a73bbcd","expr":"logger != null","rationale":"The method checks if logger is null and returns early, so at the start logger is assumed to be non-null in meaningful execution paths.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.LogHelper#warn(Logger,String):void","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/LogHelper.java","createdAt":"2026-09-15T12:14:47.611930942Z"}
{"id":"2fcabd16-53b8-43cd-ae69-280e7e8fc988","expr":"!logger.isWarnEnabled() || (msg == null || msg.length() >= 0)","rationale":"If the logger has warn level enabled, the msg is passed to logger.warn; msg.length() >= 0 always holds for non-null String.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.LogHelper#warn(Logger,String):void","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/LogHelper.java","createdAt":"2026-09-15T12:14:47.611930942Z"}
{"id":"7e894777-76bd-4442-a785-9eb8f8c2d854","expr":"logger.getClass().getName() != null","rationale":"The class name of the logger instance must be a non-null string representing the class name.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.LogHelper#warn(Logger,String):void","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/LogHelper.java","createdAt":"2026-09-15T12:14:47.611930942Z"}
{"id":"dcd21151-6d2a-434a-9bf4-c7aa0ea2aebe","expr":"msg == null || msg.length() >= 0","rationale":"The msg string is either null or has a string length that is always >= 0.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.LogHelper#warn(Logger,String):void","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/LogHelper.java","createdAt":"2026-09-15T12:14:47.611930942Z"}
{"id":"b3f0d641-3980-4d25-af15-47187a1aa093","expr":"logger != null","rationale":"The method returns immediately if logger is null, so at METHOD_EXIT logger is always non-null.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.LogHelper#error(Logger,Throwable):void","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/LogHelper.java","createdAt":"2026-09-15T12:14:50.342330312Z"}
{"id":"d62ed795-d892-43a4-b09d-729c30abd816","expr":"!logger.isErrorEnabled() || (logger.isErrorEnabled() && logger != null)","rationale":"If error is logged, logger must not be null and error enabled must be true.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.LogHelper#error(Logger,Throwable):void","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/LogHelper.java","createdAt":"2026-09-15T12:14:50.342330312Z"}
{"id":"058cd650-0877-40f3-be7f-453fa1243790","expr":"logger.isErrorEnabled() || e == null","rationale":"If error is logged (isErrorEnabled is true), e might be non-null, otherwise no error logged.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.LogHelper#error(Logger,Throwable):void","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/LogHelper.java","createdAt":"2026-09-15T12:14:50.342330312Z"}
{"id":"dbd2454f-e932-4a90-ac1d-79929ea08538","expr":"logger.isErrorEnabled() || !logger.isErrorEnabled()","rationale":"At method exit, logger.isErrorEnabled() is evaluated.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.LogHelper#error(Logger,Throwable):void","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/LogHelper.java","createdAt":"2026-09-15T12:14:50.342330312Z"}
{"id":"896411e2-0ee3-4a40-b6e0-1aa4a4c5e4c7","expr":"logger != null","rationale":"The method checks if logger is null and returns, so at the entry, logger could be null but if the method continues, logger must be non-null.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.LogHelper#error(Logger,Throwable):void","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/LogHelper.java","createdAt":"2026-09-15T12:14:50.496470285Z"}
{"id":"70428291-4178-43b5-b4cc-e71a186f97d2","expr":"!logger.isErrorEnabled() || (logger != null && logger.isErrorEnabled())","rationale":"logger.isErrorEnabled being false means no error logging, if true and logger is non-null, error can be logged.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.LogHelper#error(Logger,Throwable):void","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/LogHelper.java","createdAt":"2026-09-15T12:14:50.496470285Z"}
{"id":"adccdc38-f3d4-42d3-8750-e3ddcda25b54","expr":"logger != null","rationale":"Since the method returns early if logger is null, at this point logger must be non-null.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.LogHelper#warn(Logger,Throwable):void","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/LogHelper.java","createdAt":"2026-09-15T12:14:50.781836541Z"}
{"id":"cb4a3810-e13d-4a9e-990b-c666c49717b9","expr":"logger.isWarnEnabled() || e == null","rationale":"If warning is logged, logger.isWarnEnabled() must be true. If it is false, warn is not called, so e can be any value.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.LogHelper#warn(Logger,Throwable):void","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/LogHelper.java","createdAt":"2026-09-15T12:14:50.781836541Z"}
{"id":"dbc67428-9251-4a92-9c33-69e982a48e69","expr":"logger.isWarnEnabled() || true","rationale":"Although trivial with || true, expressing that the call to warn only happens when logger.isWarnEnabled() is true.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.LogHelper#warn(Logger,Throwable):void","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/LogHelper.java","createdAt":"2026-09-15T12:14:50.781836541Z"}
{"id":"7fec4cf3-be7a-4af7-a62f-17b350caa959","expr":"!(logger.isWarnEnabled()) || e != null || e == null","rationale":"Because e can be null or not, but if logger.isWarnEnabled() is false, the logging does not happen.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.LogHelper#warn(Logger,Throwable):void","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/LogHelper.java","createdAt":"2026-09-15T12:14:50.781836541Z"}
{"id":"ffe19011-0e5a-40e7-8fff-f310d0dab24a","expr":"logger.isWarnEnabled() || !logger.isWarnEnabled()","rationale":"This is a tautology and would normally be omitted.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.LogHelper#warn(Logger,Throwable):void","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/LogHelper.java","createdAt":"2026-09-15T12:14:50.781836541Z"}
{"id":"7c99231a-0a6b-446b-8ac0-2441aafb21fd","expr":"logger != null","rationale":"logger is checked for null before the method proceeds","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.LogHelper#warn(Logger,Throwable):void","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/LogHelper.java","createdAt":"2026-09-15T12:14:50.819236547Z"}
{"id":"ed86e920-2d2a-4150-a9a4-0f1683d364a6","expr":"logger.isWarnEnabled() == true || logger.isWarnEnabled() == false","rationale":"logger.isWarnEnabled() is a boolean method indicating if warn logging is enabled","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.LogHelper#warn(Logger,Throwable):void","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/LogHelper.java","createdAt":"2026-09-15T12:14:50.819236547Z"}
{"id":"ae074b7c-9bbf-4f2a-b5c1-4e1fb19d560c","expr":"(logger == null) || logger.isWarnEnabled()","rationale":"Because if logger is null, method returns immediately. If not null, it may check isWarnEnabled()","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.LogHelper#warn(Logger,Throwable):void","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/LogHelper.java","createdAt":"2026-09-15T12:14:50.819236547Z"}
{"id":"950a59f9-2d5b-45e3-8a81-6ec9800cc554","expr":"logger != null","rationale":"The method returns immediately if logger is null, so at this point logger must be non-null.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.LogHelper#warn(Logger,String):void","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/LogHelper.java","createdAt":"2026-09-15T12:14:51.093178845Z"}
