{"id":"3d1c84b7-d5e0-4174-9ac4-596132e0fee0","expr":"(includedPackages == null) || (includedPackages.length >= 0)","rationale":"Valid state for includedPackages being either null or a possibly empty array","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.extension.ExtensionLoader#isIncluded(String,String):boolean","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/extension/ExtensionLoader.java","createdAt":"2026-09-15T12:15:56.926125929Z"}
{"id":"60f47deb-a58b-4084-934e-23561327f9cb","expr":"(! (includedPackages != null && includedPackages.length > 0)) || (className.startsWith(includedPackages[0] + \".\") || true)","rationale":"Captures that if includedPackages is non-empty, className might start with some included package prefix","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.extension.ExtensionLoader#isIncluded(String,String):boolean","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/extension/ExtensionLoader.java","createdAt":"2026-09-15T12:15:56.926125929Z"}
{"id":"3921d7a8-3282-42f3-8091-c65ab83a3a49","expr":"(includedPackages == null || includedPackages.length == 0) || (includedPackages.length > 0)","rationale":"Simply states includedPackages length is non-negative and partitions possibilities","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.extension.ExtensionLoader#isIncluded(String,String):boolean","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/extension/ExtensionLoader.java","createdAt":"2026-09-15T12:15:56.926125929Z"}
{"id":"eba37ddc-a740-4f75-9b7e-80c2e5c5fdb8","expr":"((includedPackages != null && includedPackages.length > 0) || (includedPackages == null || includedPackages.length == 0))","rationale":"Explicitly indicates the two mutually exclusive states of includedPackages","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.extension.ExtensionLoader#isIncluded(String,String):boolean","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/extension/ExtensionLoader.java","createdAt":"2026-09-15T12:15:56.926125929Z"}
{"id":"53b54b48-64d6-4922-b302-0d85fde49e46","expr":"className != null","rationale":"The method checks if className starts with a given prefix, so className must be non-null to safely call startsWith.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.extension.ExtensionLoader#isExcludedByClassLoader(String,ClassLoader,String):boolean","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/extension/ExtensionLoader.java","createdAt":"2026-09-15T12:15:56.938734558Z"}
{"id":"5424e83c-a6a3-47fa-a6c8-09f27dc8d034","expr":"onlyExtensionClassLoaderPackages == null || onlyExtensionClassLoaderPackages.length >= 0","rationale":"The parameter onlyExtensionClassLoaderPackages is a String array (varargs), so its length is >= 0 by definition.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.extension.ExtensionLoader#isExcludedByClassLoader(String,ClassLoader,String):boolean","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/extension/ExtensionLoader.java","createdAt":"2026-09-15T12:15:56.938734558Z"}
{"id":"4ceb912f-8eb9-4c6a-8c0a-435e60ac1daa","expr":"classLoader != null || onlyExtensionClassLoaderPackages == null","rationale":"Since the method compares classLoader with ExtensionLoader's classLoader when there is an exclusion package match, classLoader usually must be non-null unless onlyExtensionClassLoaderPackages is null (no exclusions). This guards potential null classLoaders if exclusions are specified.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.extension.ExtensionLoader#isExcludedByClassLoader(String,ClassLoader,String):boolean","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/extension/ExtensionLoader.java","createdAt":"2026-09-15T12:15:56.938734558Z"}
{"id":"6b194501-3b81-4232-877c-28518742ccf9","expr":"onlyExtensionClassLoaderPackages == null || onlyExtensionClassLoaderPackages.length > 0 || true","rationale":"At the method entry, onlyExtensionClassLoaderPackages can be null or have any length including zero, so this is trivial but documents the possible states.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.extension.ExtensionLoader#isExcludedByClassLoader(String,ClassLoader,String):boolean","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/extension/ExtensionLoader.java","createdAt":"2026-09-15T12:15:56.938734558Z"}
{"id":"ec89460c-b23f-4044-a68b-753a74f3c9ba","expr":"onlyExtensionClassLoaderPackages == null || (className.startsWith(onlyExtensionClassLoaderPackages[0] + \".\") || true)","rationale":"The method conditionally checks if className starts with elements from onlyExtensionClassLoaderPackages, so if non-null, className is potentially checked against these prefixes.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.extension.ExtensionLoader#isExcludedByClassLoader(String,ClassLoader,String):boolean","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/extension/ExtensionLoader.java","createdAt":"2026-09-15T12:15:56.938734558Z"}
{"id":"f159a2e5-4f26-4879-bccf-6946932f8932","expr":"result == false || (onlyExtensionClassLoaderPackages != null && className != null && classLoader != null)","rationale":"If result is true, then the className must start with one of the exclude packages and the classLoader must be different from ExtensionLoader's class loader.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.extension.ExtensionLoader#isExcludedByClassLoader(String,ClassLoader,String):boolean","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/extension/ExtensionLoader.java","createdAt":"2026-09-15T12:15:56.946701705Z"}
{"id":"67831a6f-4e5c-40f6-9cf6-a56c7e889ed6","expr":"!result || onlyExtensionClassLoaderPackages.length > 0","rationale":"The method returns true only if there is at least one package prefix given.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.extension.ExtensionLoader#isExcludedByClassLoader(String,ClassLoader,String):boolean","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/extension/ExtensionLoader.java","createdAt":"2026-09-15T12:15:56.946701705Z"}
{"id":"2aa22dde-b9bc-41b1-9ad3-770049f314e2","expr":"!result || className != null","rationale":"The method checks if className starts with the exclude package prefix, so className must not be null.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.extension.ExtensionLoader#isExcludedByClassLoader(String,ClassLoader,String):boolean","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/extension/ExtensionLoader.java","createdAt":"2026-09-15T12:15:56.946701705Z"}
