{"id":"50487ab2-4ee4-4505-8148-9811d9a71204","expr":"!overridden || extensionClasses.containsValue(clazz)","rationale":"Overridden classes are saved in extensionClasses by saveInExtensionClass, so if overridden, clazz must be contained in extensionClasses.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.extension.ExtensionLoader#loadClass(ClassLoader,Map<String, Class<?>>,java.net.URL,Class<?>,String,boolean):void","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/extension/ExtensionLoader.java","createdAt":"2026-09-15T12:15:57.014049940Z"}
{"id":"0f717f13-14b2-418b-b4ad-a5ae02a9097a","expr":"name == null || !name.isEmpty()","rationale":"If name is empty, an IllegalStateException is thrown; therefore, at this point, if name is not null, it must not be empty.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.extension.ExtensionLoader#loadClass(ClassLoader,Map<String, Class<?>>,java.net.URL,Class<?>,String,boolean):void","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/extension/ExtensionLoader.java","createdAt":"2026-09-15T12:15:57.014049940Z"}
{"id":"a4b6caee-2aa3-4f1e-9239-4b937d1bcac1","expr":"resourceURL != null","rationale":"resourceURL is used in exception message paths and is expected to be non-null when this method completes successfully.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.extension.ExtensionLoader#loadClass(ClassLoader,Map<String, Class<?>>,java.net.URL,Class<?>,String,boolean):void","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/extension/ExtensionLoader.java","createdAt":"2026-09-15T12:15:57.014049940Z"}
{"id":"d6f5851e-022a-4732-880b-5afa6775bd69","expr":"extensionClasses != null","rationale":"extensionClasses is used as a map to save classes; it must not be null at method exit.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.extension.ExtensionLoader#loadClass(ClassLoader,Map<String, Class<?>>,java.net.URL,Class<?>,String,boolean):void","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/extension/ExtensionLoader.java","createdAt":"2026-09-15T12:15:57.014049940Z"}
{"id":"51413848-b84d-415b-8fb1-af3a90faa21f","expr":"clazz != null","rationale":"The method uses clazz as a key in cachedNames; it must be non-null.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.extension.ExtensionLoader#cacheName(Class<?>,String):void","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/extension/ExtensionLoader.java","createdAt":"2026-09-15T12:15:57.031559310Z"}
{"id":"be7e565d-d159-40f9-abdb-0f1ad8de8032","expr":"name != null","rationale":"The method caches name; it should be non-null to be meaningful.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.extension.ExtensionLoader#cacheName(Class<?>,String):void","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/extension/ExtensionLoader.java","createdAt":"2026-09-15T12:15:57.031559310Z"}
{"id":"c9160882-cbcc-48a2-a238-3c1e60957602","expr":"extensionClasses != null","rationale":"The map of extension classes must be non-null to perform the extension saving logic safely.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.extension.ExtensionLoader#saveInExtensionClass(Map<String, Class<?>>,Class<?>,String,boolean):void","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/extension/ExtensionLoader.java","createdAt":"2026-09-15T12:15:57.039070488Z"}
{"id":"47b8beaa-2428-436e-b4e8-5dced9b0ac7a","expr":"clazz != null","rationale":"The class to save as extension must be non-null because it is being inserted into the map.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.extension.ExtensionLoader#saveInExtensionClass(Map<String, Class<?>>,Class<?>,String,boolean):void","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/extension/ExtensionLoader.java","createdAt":"2026-09-15T12:15:57.039070488Z"}
{"id":"e072918c-31ae-4dc1-948e-bef084e35d80","expr":"name != null && !name.isEmpty()","rationale":"The name key used for the extension classes map should be non-null and non-empty to be consistent with being a map key.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.extension.ExtensionLoader#saveInExtensionClass(Map<String, Class<?>>,Class<?>,String,boolean):void","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/extension/ExtensionLoader.java","createdAt":"2026-09-15T12:15:57.039070488Z"}
{"id":"3efb04fe-551e-4d7b-8620-3165d7d7d94f","expr":"!(extensionClasses.containsKey(name) && !overridden && extensionClasses.get(name) != clazz)","rationale":"If there is already a different class mapped to the name and overridden flag is false, this method throws an exception, so this condition cannot hold at entry.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.extension.ExtensionLoader#saveInExtensionClass(Map<String, Class<?>>,Class<?>,String,boolean):void","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/extension/ExtensionLoader.java","createdAt":"2026-09-15T12:15:57.039070488Z"}
{"id":"6415e7a7-207b-4a13-b86e-0e9e8291d152","expr":"overridden == (extensionClasses.containsKey(name) && extensionClasses.get(name) != clazz)","rationale":"The overridden flag indicates whether the existing class for the name can be replaced, which occurs only if there is a different class already mapped.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.extension.ExtensionLoader#saveInExtensionClass(Map<String, Class<?>>,Class<?>,String,boolean):void","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/extension/ExtensionLoader.java","createdAt":"2026-09-15T12:15:57.039070488Z"}
{"id":"7118d20c-0759-4b6e-bd7e-371f9970d065","expr":"extensionClasses.get(name) == clazz || overridden","rationale":"Because if overridden is false and the existing class differs from clazz, an exception would be thrown, so at method exit either they are equal or overridden is true.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.extension.ExtensionLoader#saveInExtensionClass(Map<String, Class<?>>,Class<?>,String,boolean):void","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/extension/ExtensionLoader.java","createdAt":"2026-09-15T12:15:57.053470191Z"}
{"id":"576b6a9c-5359-4b72-b568-63b60a456fc5","expr":"extensionClasses.containsKey(name)","rationale":"The method either adds or validates the entry, so the name should be in the map.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.extension.ExtensionLoader#saveInExtensionClass(Map<String, Class<?>>,Class<?>,String,boolean):void","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/extension/ExtensionLoader.java","createdAt":"2026-09-15T12:15:57.053470191Z"}
{"id":"08ca58d7-7c6e-4eb5-8b15-a68388748143","expr":"extensionClasses.get(name) == clazz","rationale":"As the method enforces that after execution, the map entry for name must be clazz.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.extension.ExtensionLoader#saveInExtensionClass(Map<String, Class<?>>,Class<?>,String,boolean):void","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/extension/ExtensionLoader.java","createdAt":"2026-09-15T12:15:57.053470191Z"}
{"id":"a7317cbe-bedb-4cff-bc66-64848a0cfeda","expr":"name != null","rationale":"Usually, name should not be null to act as a valid map key.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.extension.ExtensionLoader#saveInExtensionClass(Map<String, Class<?>>,Class<?>,String,boolean):void","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/extension/ExtensionLoader.java","createdAt":"2026-09-15T12:15:57.053470191Z"}
