{"id":"d360b350-e5e6-46dd-8c7c-607b65483ab8","expr":"name != null","rationale":"Name key is used to cache activates, so it is assumed non-null for safe map operations.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.extension.ExtensionLoader#cacheActivateClass(Class<?>,String):void","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/extension/ExtensionLoader.java","createdAt":"2026-09-15T12:15:57.077400294Z"}
