{"id":"efb13c93-b0c3-4ad7-af99-6c38de8cf78b","expr":"clazz != null","rationale":"Input clazz is the cachedAdaptiveClass candidate and expected not to be null.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.extension.ExtensionLoader#cacheAdaptiveClass(Class<?>,boolean):void","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/extension/ExtensionLoader.java","createdAt":"2026-09-15T12:15:57.100654385Z"}
{"id":"1a77fcb5-93c3-4ac7-baeb-6a81d3b817b6","expr":"clazz != null","rationale":"The method relies on clazz to look up annotations, so clazz is likely non-null.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.extension.ExtensionLoader#cacheActivateClass(Class<?>,String):void","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/extension/ExtensionLoader.java","createdAt":"2026-09-15T12:15:57.101568978Z"}
{"id":"09dfa66f-991f-4ca4-82ea-4ff3d90d5c68","expr":"name != null","rationale":"The name string is used as a key in a map, so it should be non-null.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.extension.ExtensionLoader#cacheActivateClass(Class<?>,String):void","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/extension/ExtensionLoader.java","createdAt":"2026-09-15T12:15:57.101568978Z"}
